{%- comment -%}
  Section header — the heading block every section opens with: eyebrow, title, intro and an optional action, through the Heading atom.
  Ports the header of PerfectlyRad's Section layout (layout/Section.tsx): the eyebrow never carries a rule, the block is capped at the md width, centered when asked.

  {% render 'section-header', eyebrow: 'Aliados', title: 'Crece con nosotros', intro: '<p>Texto</p>', size: 'h2', align: 'center', cta_label: 'Registrarme', cta_href: '/x' %}

  Params
  - eyebrow, title      plain text (title may hold inline html)
  - eyebrow_style       eyebrow | body | chip (see heading)
  - intro               rich text html (from a richtext setting) or plain text; rendered as body-lg copy
  - size                display | h1 | h2 | h3   (default: h2)
  - align               left | center   (default: left)
  - as                  tag of the title (default: h2)
  - cta_label, cta_href primary action (button atom)
  - extra               html under the intro: a button row, a note
  - class
  Renders nothing when everything is blank.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign sh_empty = true
  if eyebrow != blank or title != blank or intro != blank or cta_label != blank
    assign sh_empty = false
  endif
  assign sh_align = align | default: 'left'
-%}
{%- unless sh_empty -%}
  {%- capture sh_intro -%}
    {%- if intro != blank -%}{%- render 'typography', text: intro, as: 'div', variant: 'body-lg', class: 'pr-section-header__intro rte' -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- if extra != blank -%}{{ extra }}{%- endif -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  <div class="pr-section-header pr-section-header--{{ sh_align }}{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}">
    {%- render 'heading', eyebrow: eyebrow, eyebrow_style: eyebrow_style, title: title, as: as, size: size, align: sh_align, content: sh_intro, cta_label: cta_label, cta_href: cta_href -%}
  </div>
{%- endunless -%}
